d\"\n              >\n                business section\n              </Link>{' '}\n              covers nail salons by region and client type. Getting listed puts your salon in front of readers actively looking for nail services.\n            </p>\n\n            <div className=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n              <div className=\"border border-foreground/10 p-8\">\n                <h3\n                  className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                  style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n                >\n                  Salon spotlights\n                </h3>\n                <p\n                  className=\"font-body text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed\"\n                  style={{ fontFamily: 'Crimson Text, Georgia, serif' }}\n                >\n                  In-depth editorial features covering your salon, your work, and what makes your space worth visiting. Includes SEO-indexed pages under our business directory.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n\n              <div className=\"border border-foreground/10 p-8\">\n                <h3\n                  className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                  style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n                >\n                  Pinterest features\n                </h3>\n                <p\n                  className=\"font-body text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed\"\n                  style={{ fontFamily: 'Crimson Text, Georgia, serif' }}\n                >\n                  Your work featured on our Pinterest account reaching 1M monthly visitors. Direct attribution and traffic back to your profile or website.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n\n              <div className=\"border border-foreground/10 p-8\">\n                <h3\n                  className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                  style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n      